      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering External Providers**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a concrete external provider for the `extract_layout.py` script. The goal is to choose a reliable service capable of extracting layout elements like blocks, lines, and tables from documents. I'm leaning toward exploring options within document AI or OCR providers to fulfill this task.\n\n\n**Implementing Cloud Integration**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Document AI as the external provider. My plan is to create `extract_layout.py`, integrating the Document AI API for layout extraction. I'll focus on the extraction function, importing the Google Cloud client library, and handling authentication. I'm assuming the user will handle credential setup. Next, I will flesh out the extraction function itself, ensuring that it takes a document path as input.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867203653,
          "start": 1789867198940
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc6609dc001QN6cTBSXcQ6Kvl",
