    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing OCR Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Vision AI as the OCR engine. I'll need to write the code to make that selection concrete and integrate the API calls into the `extract_text.py` file. This means I need to focus on identifying it in the code.\n\n\n**Defining the Approach**\n\nI'm now concretizing the `extract_text.py` file. I'm focusing on integrating Google Cloud Vision AI. The implementation will include the client library, necessary imports, and client initialization. This will make Google Cloud Vision AI easily identifiable as the provider within the code. I am moving on to designing the input/output of the function.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
